      "trackName": "Cookie Tapper!",
      "description": "Cookie Tapper - The iconic cookie-clicking experience, now on your wrist!\n\nThis super polished and fully optimized for Apple Watch app brings the iconic game to your wrist. Enjoy the following features:\n\n- Satisfying click animations\n- Tons of upgrades to buy\n- Variety of cookie skins\n- Global leaderboard\n- Support for 7 languages\n- Constant updates and bug fixes\n- Friendly community\n\nDownload now and start tapping cookies!",
